{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"4502","title":"POCO M7 Pro 5G Redefines 5G Entertainment with Style and Affordability for the Next Generation","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today launched the new POCO M7 Pro 5G, bringing the advantages of 5G connectivity, upgraded hardware performance, imaging, and display technology to budget-savvy users around the world. ","view_cnt":"12745","like_cnt":"3","add_time":"1742549587","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/370_operatorx_operatorx_opx/21/03/2025/01c8add8cfa6a96773851ec1492846ae.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eBeijing, April 3rd, 2025\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e – POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today launched the new POCO M7 Pro 5G, bringing the advantages of 5G connectivity, upgraded hardware performance, imaging, and display technology to budget-savvy users around the world. Set to become the most powerful 5G device in its class, POCO M7 Pro 5G combines an exceptional entertainment experience with unbeatable value.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/47_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/59704c9713e1955967c5f49ce7e45c77.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e“POCO M7 Pro 5G embodies our commitment to delivering the next-level 5G performance and entertainment experience possible,\" says Angus Ng, Head of Product Marketing at POCO Global. “Its stunning display, powerful Dimensity 7025-Ultra chipset, sleek design, and upgraded camera system, POCO M7 Pro 5G caters to the needs of both casual users and tech enthusiasts.\"\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePowerful performance with 5G compatible Dimensity 7025-Ultra mobile platform\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eEquipped with a powerful Dimensity 7025-Ultra processor, POCO M7 Pro 5G is one of the highest-performing devices in its segment, scoring an impressive 477,003 in the AnTuTu mobile benchmark¹. This powerful chipset delivers a smooth 5G mobile gaming experience. Snappy game loading speeds are ensured with up to 12GB of fast LPDDR4X memory, plus up to 12GB of RAM expansion² via Memory Extension, supported by 256GB² of fast UFS 2.2 storage.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/246_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/30ff6c41a023a5977fed713ec1a0b988.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eExceptional battery life and lightning-fast charging\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 Pro 5G features a large 5110mAh (typ) battery³ and 45W turbo charging, ensuring entertainment continues throughout the day and beyond. Robust long-term battery health is assured with TÜV Rheinland Certification, with the battery capable of maintaining above 80% efficiency through 1600 charging cycles⁴. Battery lifespan is further improved with intelligent battery health management that adapts to user charging habits, adjusting charging strategies over time. Aging prediction and battery repair technologies further maintain battery health to extend the device's lifespan.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePremium entertainment experience with upgraded display and audio\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 Pro 5G features a 6.67\" 2400*1080 AMOLED eye-care friendly display with a peak brightness of up to 2100 nits⁵, making it the brightest display on any POCO M-Series device. Giving users a vivid, crisp viewing experience in gaming and video playback, POCO M7 Pro 5G performs exceptionally well in all scenarios, including bright outdoor environments. A fast and responsive 120Hz refresh rate⁶, plus a peak 2160Hz instant touch sampling rate⁷, ensure slick gaming performance and accurate responsiveness. At the same time, slimmer bezels and an impressive 92% screen-to-body ratio offer an expansive viewing experience. Long-term eye-care technology includes TÜV Rheinland Low Blue Light (Hardware Solution) Certification, TÜV Rheinland Flicker Free Certification, and TÜV Rheinland Circadian Friendly Certification, plus SGS eye-care certification to help maintain healthy eyesight across various viewing conditions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTo give users the most immersive 5G entertainment experience, POCO M7 Pro 5G features a dual speaker system with Dolby Atmos® and Hi-Res Audio. To combat noisy environments, POCO M7 Pro 5G packs a 300% Volume Boost⁸ to give users a compelling media experience in everyday situations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/672_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/1457045803d140e36990dd27468738e2.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eCapture amazing moments with an upgraded Sony IMX 882 sensor\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 Pro 5G features an upgraded 50MP rear camera with a large 1/1.95\" Sony IMX882 image sensor that captures up to 29.8% more light, plus a wide f/1.5 aperture lens that creates natural-looking bokeh effects. For superior image stabilization, support for both OIS and EIS, which means POCO M7 Pro 5G is equipped to capture fleeting moments without image blur, with improved video image clarity in moving scenes. Its 2X optical-grade In-Sensor Zoom allows users to create sharper shots than traditional digital zoom, while Zoom AI further improves image detail in shots taken from a distance. POCO M7 Pro 5G also features an upgraded 20MP front camera with AI 0.8X wide-angle support, automatically and intelligently switching to a wide-angle lens to ensure everybody is in the shot.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/495_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/ecf1a09fd79119b52a8c564479456c67.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 Pro 5G takes advantage of the POCO Imaging Engine, maximizing camera performance to deliver better image quality, color accuracy, and more by using advanced AI imaging algorithms. RAW Domain Ultra-Sense Night Mode offers more realistic image rendering in nighttime shots. Other advanced AI features include AI Bokeh, AI Erase, and AI Sky.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/101_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/eebcc4e1a2d384492e6fc8f7a9bd31ea.jpg\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eElegant design meets outstanding durability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eDesigned to combine slimline elegance with uncompromising durability, POCO M7 Pro 5G is thin at only 75.7mm⁹, weighs a mere 190g⁹, and feels comfortable in hand. Available in three new vibrant colors, Green, Silver, and Purple, POCO M7 Pro 5G features a cutout design that balances color with an attractive rock texture design. With seamless round edges, a curved back, and a transparent 3D curved camera module, POCO M7 Pro 5G radiates premium-grade styling. With IP64 dust and water resistance¹⁰, the device offers protection against splashes and dust particles, ensuring reliable performance in various conditions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/966_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/21/03/2025/7ebb56f5ced319f6c1562f02cdc67d2a.jpg\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eTo give users a more intuitive and intelligent mobile experience, POCO M7 Pro 5G arrives with Google Gemini app¹¹, allowing users to chat with the Gemini AI assistant and get help with writing, brainstorming, learning, and more.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eProduct availability\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO M7 Pro 5G is available in three colors: Green, Silver and Purple.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 8GB+256GB, and 12GB+256GB.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Please consult the local seller on the availability of color, storage and RAM variant.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Availability may vary by countries/regions, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*Price and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://mi.com\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003emi.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e*5G connectivity may vary based on region availability and local operator support.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹ Data tested based on AnTuTu v10 by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e² 24GB RAM with Memory extension is based on the 12GB RAM version. Additional RAM will occupy a corresponding amount of ROM storage. Memory extension is only available when there is enough storage space on your device. The actual extension of RAM storage capacity varies across different models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e³ 5110mAh refers to the typical value, as tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual battery capacity may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁴ The product has passed TÜV SUD long life battery certification, certification number Z2GCN 099551 0370, and battery capacity ≥80% after 1800 cycles in the laboratory standard environment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁵2100 nits refers to peak brightness. Data obtained from POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁶ Refresh rate can be adjusted to up to 120Hz for supported apps.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁷ 2160Hz instant touch sampling rate supported only with Game Turbo mode on.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁸ 300% Volume boost is compared to the same model at 100% volume. 300% Volume boost only works in speaker mode and doesn't work with headphones. Volume boost only works for media audio, ringtone, and notification sound; It doesn't work for Xiaomi AI assistant and alarm clock. Data tested by Xiaomi Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e⁹ Data tested by POCO Internal Labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹⁰ The device is certified to be water and dust resistant exclusively under specific laboratory conditions not corresponding to normal use conditions. The warranty does not cover liquid damage caused by conditions other than test conditions. Ingress protection might deteriorate due to wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed for repair. For more information, please see official website.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003e¹¹ Gemini is a trademark of Google LLC. Gemini mobile app available on select devices, languages, and countries. Internet connection required. Check responses for accuracy.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: start\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: [object Object]px; color: [object Object]\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy – \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" – drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making to accelerate the company's evolution and refresh the smartphone industry.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"10364","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1743608921"},"common":null}